WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Play: swipe a ball toward the hoop. Build your streak to raise Fever.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
Practice on Orbit: space gravity changes the shot.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
Practice on Storm: read the wind indicator and adjust your aim.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
Practice on Mist: follow the hoop's light through the fog.
